===Format===
* '''Rules:'''
<!-- ** All matches are played in [[Game_Modes#Captain's_Draft|Captain's Draft]] game mode -->
** Contract system (players can earn extra prize money through in-game contracts: 300,000 RUB total)

* '''Group Stage:'''
** Two groups of 5 teams each
** Round Robin format
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Top 2 teams from each group advance to the Playoffs Upper Bracket
** 3rd place teams from each group advance to the Playoffs Lower Bracket
** 4th and 5th place teams are eliminated

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

